[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9901.349, "timestamp": "02:45:01", "text": "不，不，不。当我的房间，我的直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9904.55, "timestamp": "02:45:04", "text": "房间当时正在施工等等。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9908.309, "timestamp": "02:45:08", "text": "嗯，我以前会把电脑和游戏放在一起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9911.03, "timestamp": "02:45:11", "text": "客厅里那台死机的电脑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9913.59, "timestamp": "02:45:13", "text": "不，呃，我去年就是这么做的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9915.429, "timestamp": "02:45:15", "text": "呼啸的巨浪之类的东西。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9917.429, "timestamp": "02:45:17", "text": "你还记得那些小溪吗？我想你当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9921.11, "timestamp": "02:45:21", "text": "那里。是的。对，就是那一次。是的。那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9923.429, "timestamp": "02:45:23", "text": "时间。是的，就在客厅里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9925.269, "timestamp": "02:45:25", "text": "所以在清理完电脑之后，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9928.309, "timestamp": "02:45:28", "text": "一切都像是在拖着它一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9931.75, "timestamp": "02:45:31", "text": "我刚把玻璃部件取下来了，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9935.75, "timestamp": "02:45:35", "text": "把它放下，然后不小心有点……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9938.63, "timestamp": "02:45:38", "text": "用力过猛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9941.03, "timestamp": "02:45:41", "text": "因为我没看到其中一个螺丝，所以就把它拆开了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9943.349, "timestamp": "02:45:43", "text": "或者角落。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9946.07, "timestamp": "02:45:46", "text": "是的，它从角落处碎裂了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9947.99, "timestamp": "02:45:47", "text": "关键在于，这就是全部。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9952.389, "timestamp": "02:45:52", "text": "破碎了。唯一的原因就是它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9955.19, "timestamp": "02:45:55", "text": "由于贴纸的缘故，它现在完好无损了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9958.309, "timestamp": "02:45:58", "text": "面板贴纸就在那里。"}]